  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plan submitted numbered DP/1617/RG/01A and received on 21st April 2011 therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No fans, louvres, ducts or other external plant shall be installed without the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times Monday to Saturday 7am to 6pm and Sunday and bank holidays 9am to 4pm.",
    "Condition : 5 - The access doorway to the ground floor of No.7 Grove Park Road, Chiswick shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 6 - If in the future hot foods are to be prepared and cooked on site then further information with regard to this needs to be submitted to the Local Planning Authority.  Details of additional appliances and any ventilation measures proposed shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
